        "created_at": "2021-12-16T02:07:01.763Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"The_Justifier\" data-post=\"11\" data-topic=\"28974\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/the_justifier/48/4954_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> The_Justifier:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Hannukah revolves around olive oil</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Hanukkah revolves around a guerilla victory over an oppressive regime. The <em>lamp</em> oil is something of an addition to that.</p>",
