      {
        "id": 241691,
        "name": "OddballPaladin",
        "username": "OddballPaladin",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/o/d26b3c/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2021-12-16T03:05:13.057Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Trajector\" data-post=\"21\" data-topic=\"28974\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/trajector/48/1914_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Trajector:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Hanukkah revolves around a guerilla victory over an oppressive regime.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Under a leader with a name that means “The Hammer.”</p>\n<p>Good summary here: <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8Q2FjJAUT0U&amp;t=198s\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8Q2FjJAUT0U&amp;t=198s</a></p>\n<p>Also, according to my Jewish in-laws, Hanukkah is a fairly minor holiday. The gift giving seems to be something added to keep the kids from getting mad about missing the winter gift-giving holiday in America.</p>",
