        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/o/d26b3c/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2021-12-16T14:06:18.142Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Trajector\" data-post=\"24\" data-topic=\"28974\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/trajector/48/1914_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Trajector:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>The stories told, the songs, the dreidel game, and so on focus on themes like the struggle for freedom or holding on to your beliefs in the face of coercion.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>As my wife put it when we were discussing various respective holy days, many Jewish holidays can be summed up as “they tried to kill us, they failed, let’s eat.”</p>",
